{title: Párate}
{key: D}
{meta: rhythm Paso doble}
{meta: source Tunabundel – Tuna Ciudad de Luz}
{define: Edim base-fret 1 frets x 1 2 0 2 0}

{comment: Intro}
| [Gm] | . | [D] | [Fdim] |
| [Em] | [A7] | [*40] [*44] [*32] [*44] |

{start_of_verse: Couplet 1}
[*40] [*50]Tú [*52]sa[*54]bes [D]bien que me enamoro de tu boca
[*40] [*50]Cuan[*52]do [*54]me [D]miras en silencio entre la gente
[*40] [*40]tú [*42]sa[*44]bes [G]bien que alguna pieza se disloca
[*63] [*62]den[*63]tro [*64]de [A7]mí cuando me miras fijamente
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Couplet 2}
[*40] [*50]Pe[*52]ro [*54]tú [D]sabes bien que cuando yo te cante
[*40] [*40]ba[*42]jo [*43]la [F]luna de Valencia en tu bal[Bm]cón
[*52] [*52]co[*54]mo [*40]nin[E]gún desconocido habrá delante
[*60] [*60]en[*62]ton[*64]ces [A7]tú me entregarás tu corazón.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrein}
[*50] [*50]Y [*52]dir[*54]as [D]párate, párate, párate
[*40] [*50]Y [*40]dir[*42]as [Bb7]cántame, cán[A7]tame, cánta[D]me
[*40] [*40]Y [*42]dir[*44]as [G]mírame, mirame, miramé
[*63] [*62]Y [*63]dir[*64]as [A7]bésame, besame, besamé 2x
[Gm]Cuando pase con mi [D]Tuna
